{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_016cs5z61bw9TvUjRSM78QCb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All thirteen checklist items are complete — the full suite passes (1248 tests: 1145 engine regression + 39 FDN reference + 64 new SOS tests), all ten cards import cleanly with spec-matching names, and each card has its own commit.\n\n**What was built**\n\n*Shared engine seams (E1–E3):* `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from `cast_spell` and `cast_spell_free` (a free cast is still a cast per rule 601; copies correctly don't fire it); `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fires from `advance_phase` after mana pools empty; and `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents for instant/sorcery spells.\n\n*The ten cards,* each with 4–8 real-engine tests plus an independent throwaway smoke check: Together as One (converge via `colors_spent`), The Dawning Archaic, Witherbloom, Silverquill (casualty via the fdn_248 copy pattern), Great Hall of the Biblioplex, Mana Sculpt, Improvisation Capstone (Paradigm), Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares (rule-722 prepared), Lorehold (card-local miracle), and Ral Zarek (surveil / reanimate / coin-flip / skip-turns).\n\n**Notable spec-grounded deviations from the plan** (all logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md` with notes beside the TODO items):\n- `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was defined but never fired anywhere — added a fire in `declare_attackers_step`, without which no attack trigger can work.\n- Self-ETB triggers never fire in this engine (the event fires before the entering card registers), so sos_13's enters ability lives in `on_resolve`, matching fdn_205, the reference ETB card that ships with tests.\n- Rule 722 says casting a prepared copy **pays** its cost and the copy is created in exile at the moment of becoming prepared — implemented that way rather than the TODO's free-cast sketch.\n- sos_57's Wizard condition is checked at resolution (it gates creating the delayed ability), and \"amount of mana spent\" needed a new `ManaPool.last_payment_amount` / `card.mana_spent` seam.\n- sos_1's exile-instead wraps the free-cast spell's stack resolution, since the engine only consults replacement effects on battlefield-leave.\n\nCard-local gaps stayed card-local: restricted mana is a single \"instant/sorcery-only\" pool in `ManaPool`, skip-turns is a seat-indexed counter consumed in the turn wrap, and miracle/casualty/paradigm/preparation each live entirely in their card's `card_impl.py`. All engine edits were additive — nothing renamed, moved, or deleted, and `engine_tests/` stayed green after every change."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":434,"cache_read_input_tokens":310148,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":434},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"203bfe5f-57c4-4989-b6d0-2f9d784eca4e","uuid":"af40c4ec-fbd0-473a-923e-c6b543aea73e","request_id":"req_011CbtdMdarUJ22AN4zktqiJ"}
